{"language":"jp","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","神圣御空"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/jp","神聖飛行"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时获得护盾以及逐渐损失的额外生命上限，并且会在自身生命恢复至上限后进入“神临”状态。主动释放时对前方3格扇形范围造成真实伤害并恢复自身生命值。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/jp","戦闘開始時にシールドと追加のHP上限を獲得。獲得した追加のHP上限は徐々に減少する。自身のHPがHP上限まで回復した後、「降臨」状態になる。アクティブ効果：前方3マスの扇状範囲内の敵に確定ダメージを与え、自身のHPを回復"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时巴赫朗获得80% + 5%初始生命值的护盾以及300% HP额外生命上限且当前生命值不变，这部分额外生命上限每秒损失2%。战斗中巴赫朗生命恢复至上限后展开双翼，对周围2格敌人造成10% HP伤害并进入“神临”状态：不再损失本技能获得的额外生命上限，并且普通攻击会对面前1格扇形区域内的所有敌军造成伤害。逐渐获得额外生命上限以及进入“神临”状态的动作期间处于霸体状态。\n主动释放时，向圣剑注入神力，对前方3格扇形范围内所有敌人造成280% + 40% ATK真实伤害，随后自身恢复实际伤害量40%的生命值。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","戦闘開始時、初期HP×80% + 5%分のシールドと300% HPの追加のHP上限を獲得。ただし現在HPは変化しない。獲得した追加のHP上限は毎秒-2%。戦闘中、自身のHPがHP上限まで回復した後、翼を広げ、周囲2マスの敵に10% HPのダメージを与え、「降臨」状態になり、以下の効果を獲得：このスキルによって獲得した追加のHP上限が減少しなくなり、通常攻撃は前方1マスの扇状範囲内の敵全体にダメージを与える。追加のHP上限を獲得するモーション中、及び「降臨」状態に入るモーション中はスーパーアーマー状態になる\nアクティブ効果：聖剣に神力を注ぎ、前方3マスの扇状範囲内の敵全体に280% + 40% ATKの確定ダメージを与え、実際に与えたダメージ×40%分のHPを回復"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":18,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":223,"end":229,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":14,"end":19,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":293,"end":299,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":28,"end":35,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"},{"start":94,"end":100,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"},{"start":183,"end":185,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"},{"start":219,"end":233,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":26,"end":33,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"},{"start":112,"end":118,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"},{"start":242,"end":250,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"},{"start":289,"end":303,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","主动释放时造成的伤害提高至300% + 40% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","アクティブ効果のダメージが300% + 40% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":23,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":17,"end":23,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":13,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","主动释放时造成的伤害提高至320% + 40% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","アクティブ効果のダメージが320% + 40% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":23,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":17,"end":23,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":13,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","主动释放时造成的伤害提高至340% + 40% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","アクティブ効果のダメージが340% + 40% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":23,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":17,"end":23,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":13,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","主动释放时造成的伤害提高至360% + 40% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/jp","アクティブ効果のダメージが360% + 40% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":23,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":17,"end":23,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":13,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","圣域共鸣"],["/skills/1/name_i18n/jp","聖域共鳴"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","被动地，巴赫朗在战斗中持续恢复生命值。“神临”状态下攻击会对敌人造成额外真实伤害。"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/jp","パッシブ効果：持続的に自身のHPを回復。「降臨」状態になると、攻撃が敵にヒットするたびに、「聖光」により追加で確定ダメージを与える"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","被动地，巴赫朗每秒恢复2% HP生命值；进入“神临”状态后，圣剑永久附着“圣光”，在每次命中敌人时额外附带1.5% + 0.25% HP真实伤害。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","パッシブ効果：自身は毎秒、2% HPのHPを回復。「降臨」状態になると、聖剣に永続的に「聖光」が付与され、攻撃が敵にヒットするたびに、「聖光」により追加で1.5% + 0.25% HPの確定ダメージを与える"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":57,"end":65,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":81,"end":89,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":16,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"},{"start":53,"end":68,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":13,"end":18,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"},{"start":77,"end":92,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","“圣光”额外附带伤害提高至1.8% + 0.25% HP。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","「聖光」による追加ダメージが1.8% + 0.25% HPにUP"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":25,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":18,"end":26,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/descr